  "notes": "Citibank runs its own TalentBrew/Radancy server-rendered search at jobs.citi.com (org 287), not a Workday board; the Workday link appears only on each job detail. The GET form posts k (keyword) and l (location) to /search-jobs, with ?p=N pagination (15 rows) and sort=11 (Date Posted) / sort=0 (Relevancy) from the page's sort select. ?k=engineer&l=India&sort=11 returned data-keywords=engineer, data-location=India, 944 results, 63 pages, Date Posted selected and data-sort-criteria=5/1. Facets are checkboxes with data-id/data-facet-type sent to the /search-jobs/results AJAX endpoint; a direct call with FacetTerm/FacetType did not change the total, so facet params stay local.",
